  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper presents an agentic, gate-based QAOA portfolio-optimization workflow on a 5-asset universe using 5 qubits and 5 layers, executed on Qiskit BasicSimulator, AWS Tensor Network simulator, and QBraid QIR state-vector simulator. It reports a 210-gate circuit with transpiled depth 93, 1,000 and 2,000 shot runs, and a dominant bitstring 01011 occurring with 23.55% probability, yielding a 31.17% return, 19.29% volatility, and Sharpe ratio 1.62. No physical QPU or classical-vs-quantum advantage benchmark is demonstrated.",
